---
const services = ['Brand Strategy', 'Visual Identity', 'Web & Product', 'WebGL / 3D', 'Motion Design', 'Art Direction'];
---
<section class="studio" id="studio">
  <p class="statement reveal">
    Somos un estudio independiente que mezcla <em>estrategia</em>, diseño y tecnología para construir mundos
    de marca que se sienten <em>imposibles</em> — y funcionan en la vida real.
  </p>
  <div class="cols">
    <div class="reveal">
      <h4>Servicios</h4>
      <ul>{services.map((s) => <li>{s}</li>)}</ul>
    </div>
    <div class="stats reveal">
      <div><strong>12</strong><span>años creando</span></div>
      <div><strong>140+</strong><span>proyectos</span></div>
      <div><strong>18</strong><span>premios</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
  .studio { background: var(--ink); color: var(--paper); padding: 9rem 2.2rem; }
  .statement { font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4.2vw, 3.6rem); line-height: 1.12; letter-spacing: -.03em; max-width: 22ch; }
  .statement em { font-family: var(--serif); color: var(--lilac); }
  .cols { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.4fr; gap: 3rem; margin-top: 6rem; border-top: 1px solid rgba(243,230,227,.2); padding-top: 2.5rem; }
  h4 { font-weight: 400; font-size: .85rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .08em; opacity: .6; margin-bottom: 1.2rem; }
  ul { list-style: none; font-size: 1.3rem; line-height: 1.7; }
  .stats { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 1.5rem; }
  .stats strong { display: block; font-family: var(--serif); font-weight: 400; font-size: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 5.5rem); line-height: 1; }
  .stats span { opacity: .65; }
  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .studio { padding: 6rem 16px; }
    .cols { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
</style>
